                        (Becoming.RuleShaping.byBack a p c pos (Becoming.RuleShaping.thresholdBack hi lo)) reads
                        (x, Becoming.RuleShaping.shaped a hi p c pos) t).fst.other
@Becoming.RuleShaping.threshold_present_below : ∀ {a p c hi lo : Nat} {pos : 0 < a},
